# {{.Folder}}/ is generated by gcluster: do not edit

Every file in this folder was generated by `gcluster create`. Do not edit, patch,
or "fix" files here (main.tf, terraform.tfvars, ...); gcluster overwrites them.

Fix errors reported in these files (for example "main.tf line 71") at the source,
then regenerate with `gcluster create <blueprint.yaml> -d <deployment.yaml> -w`:
- values (project, region/zone, sizes, machine types): deployment.yaml
- anything else: the blueprint YAML. If it is a tracked example (under examples/ or
  community/examples/), copy it to a new file, add `ai_assisted: true`, and edit the
  copy instead.
